B.QY=new A.cl('Why are deep learning models called "black boxes"?',B.JI,1,'The passage states their "decision-making processes are opaque even to their creators."')
B.It=s(["It is unnecessary","It could stifle innovation","AI is always fair","Regulation is too expensive"],t.s)
B.R7=new A.cl("What is the main argument against AI regulation?",B.It,1,'Critics "contend that excessive regulation could stifle innovation and put countries at a competitive disadvantage."')
