B.Kz=s(["A city built in 15 minutes","All services accessible within 15-minute walk/bike","A city with 15-minute commutes by car","A city planning model taking 15 minutes to design"],t.s)
B.R2=new A.cl('What does the "15-minute city" concept mean?',B.Kz,1,'The passage defines it as where "all essential services are accessible within a 15-minute walk or bike ride."')
B.Ml=s(["Ignoring","Struggling to deal with","Celebrating","Measuring"],t.s)
